Ясно / Credit MVP — third-party components and simulated integrations

Runtime:
- CPython 3.12.10 and its standard library. Python Software Foundation License.
  Official license: https://docs.python.org/3.12/license.html
- SQLite, accessed through Python sqlite3. SQLite is in the public domain.
  Official statement: https://www.sqlite.org/copyright.html
  The embedded SQLite version is supplied by the selected Python build.
- Docker base image: python:3.12.10-slim-bookworm, from Docker Official Images.
  Includes Debian system components under their respective licenses; image notices
  are normally available under /usr/share/doc/*/copyright in the container.
  Base-image tag pins Python version, not an immutable OS-layer digest.
- Docker / Docker Compose provide the primary reproducible delivery path; not vendored here.

Frontend:
- Plain HTML, CSS and JavaScript. No npm libraries, CDNs or downloaded fonts.
- System fonts are used from the user's operating system.

Models, datasets, external services:
- Optional demo hosting configuration: Render (render.yaml), using the same Docker image.
  No paid plan, cloud API key or external request is required for local Docker operation.
  Render terms and free-tier limits: https://render.com/docs/free
- No trained ML model, LLM, model weights or third-party dataset is included.
- All demo profiles, tax-id strings, rates and thresholds are fictional.
- Company registry and credit-bureau checks are deterministic local simulations
  in scoring.py, not integrations with FNS, EGRUL/EGRIP, BKI or Alfa-Bank.
- Authentication is simulated with fixed demo accounts.
- Signing, lending offers and disbursement are simulated; no documents are signed
  with legal effect and no money moves.

Design references:
- Alfa Core DS: https://core-ds.github.io/core-components/master/?path=/docs/intro--docs
  Visual principles are adapted in native HTML/CSS; the React library is not bundled.
- Push character: art direction and character design by Alfa-Bank; animation by
  ITSALIVE. The supplied public portfolio image is used in this local design prototype.
  Portfolio: https://itsalive.studio/works/push
  Image: https://static.tildacdn.one/tild3934-3438-4531-a161-373830336166/image_2090012256.png
  Local file: static/push.png. This file is not under a permissive code license.
- Cozmo (https://cozmo.mx/) was inspected as an interaction reference.
  No Cozmo code, images or other assets are included.

The advisor conversation is a scripted prototype in static/advisor.js, not an LLM.
The user-provided case image informed the prototype and is not redistributed here.

No source-code license for the team's own work is imposed by this notices file.
